      "body": "Implements the remainder of #1215 (queue task 4925), as triaged by task 2491:\n\n- **Light theme:** a real light palette under `@media (prefers-color-scheme: light)` covering body, nav, cards, badges, banners, tables, links, forms, chips and dots. The dark palette is unchanged as the default.\n- **Non-colour cues:** state badges also differ by icon prefix (`::before` per state class — walled/blocked, needs-Drew, healthy/merged/acked, pending/stale, review, rejected, snoozed, open); status dots also differ by shape (down/invalid square, stale/absent diamond, fixtures hollow ring). Acknowledged cards now carry a visible \"✓ Acknowledged\" badge instead of only reduced opacity.\n- **One navigation model:** the nav bar and the Pages dropdown now list the identical destination set under the same grouping — the bar no longer excludes `/pages`, and the dropdown mirrors the sections as `<optgroup>`s (new exported `pageDropdown()`). Manifest coherence fixes that fall out of this: the overview page now names its `group` (it was missing — a live TS error on main and the cause of two failing nav tests), and the board page's manifest route is `/board`, matching the server and the overview tests (routes are now unique).\n- **Table semantics:** all 26 aggregator tables get a `<caption>`, every column header gets `scope=\"col\"`, and existing row headers get `scope=\"row\"`.\n\nTests: new `test/a11y-1215.test.ts` (light block surfaces, badge/dot cues, bar↔dropdown destination-set equality, caption/scope invariants) + updated `nav.test.ts` expectations for the unified model. Full suite on the laptop worktree: 747 pass / 2 fail — one is the pre-existing attention-controls failure (also failing on clean main), the other a store-lock timing flake that passes standalone (11/11). Baseline on clean main was 731 pass / 7 fail; the five manifest/nav failures are fixed by this PR. `tsc --noEmit` errors drop from 8 on main to 1 (a pre-existing bun-types environment error).\n\nRefs #1215 — the issue stays open until this merges; remaining scope (layout/content redesign) was explicitly excluded by the packet.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/3308?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796095128&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=3308&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F3308&signature=f51c7b9ebcecc9bc2711ed46e4839f2c4946bb4a8011eccc9888671d554cd87a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
